# =============================================================================
# defaults.local.conf — machine-specific macOS preference overrides
#
# Copy this file to defaults.local.conf (gitignored) to override values from
# defaults.conf on THIS machine only. It is applied AFTER defaults.conf, so
# rows here win on conflicting (domain, key) pairs.
#
# `dotfiles defaults --sync` regenerates this file automatically, capturing every
# managed key whose current system value differs from the committed base.
#
# Format is identical to defaults.conf:
#   group  domain  key  type  value
# =============================================================================

# Examples (uncomment / edit as needed):

# dock          com.apple.dock           tilesize    int     64
# screenshots   com.apple.screencapture  location    string  ~/Screenshots
